---

<section id="growth-stack" class="section growth-section section-soft">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="growth-intro">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Growth tools included</p>
              <h2>Site + SEO + Analytics.<br /><em>Ready by default.</em></h2>
            </div>
            <p>
              A WhatsApp catalog helps customers browse inside WhatsApp. WhatsCart adds the public
              business presence and feedback loop you need to grow beyond a chat thread.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="growth-grid">
            <article class="growth-card">
              <div class="growth-card-top"><span>01</span><b>Site</b></div>
              <h3>A branded home customers can open anywhere.</h3>
              <p>
                Your logo, colors, products, categories, collections, contact details, and
                shareable <strong>.whatscart.in</strong> address.
              </p>
              <div class="site-mini-ui">
                <span>yourname.whatscart.in</span>
                <i></i><i></i><i></i>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="growth-card dark-card">
              <div class="growth-card-top"><span>02</span><b>SEO + GEO/LLMO</b></div>
              <h3>Built so search engines and AI systems can understand it.</h3>
              <p>
                Canonical metadata, crawlable pages, XML sitemaps, rich share previews,
                and Schema.org product and store data—without pretending to guarantee rankings.
              </p>
              <div class="code-mini-ui" aria-hidden="true">
                <code>&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;</code>
                <!-- <code>{ "@type": "OnlineStore" }</code> -->
                <code>sitemap.xml · canonical · Open Graph</code>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="growth-card analytics-card">
              <div class="growth-card-top"><span>03</span><b>Analytics</b></div>
              <h3>See what is working, not just what was posted.</h3>
              <p>
                Track visits, orders, revenue, best sellers, top customers, and whether traffic
                came from WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, a copied link, or organic discovery.
              </p>
              <div class="analytics-mini-ui">
                <div><small>Views</small><strong>1,000+</strong></div>
                <div><small>Traffic sources</small><span class="source-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
